@startuml
title 领域概念与事实所有权（AI-辅助）
left to right direction
hide methods
package "space-service" {
  class ParkingSpace {
    spaceId
    type
    floor
    zone
    number
    status
  }
  class Charger {
    chargerId
    spaceId
  }
  class ChargingSession {
    chargingSessionId
    parkingSessionId
    energyKwh
    chargingCents
  }
}
package "access-service" {
  class ParkingSession {
    parkingSessionId
    plateNumber
    entryTime
    exitTime
    status
  }
}
package "pass-service" {
  class Reservation {
    reservationId
    plateNumber
    spaceId
    startTime
    endTime
    status
  }
  class MonthlyPass {
    monthlyPassId
    plateNumber
    balanceCents
    startTime
    endTime
  }
}
package "billing-service" {
  class Bill {
    billId
    parkingSessionId
    rateVersion
    amountDueCents
    status
  }
  class Payment {
    paymentId
    billId
    paymentSource
    paymentStatus
  }
  class InvoiceRequest {
    invoiceRequestId
    billId
    status
  }
}
ParkingSpace "1" -- "0..*" ParkingSession : spaceId
ParkingSpace "1" -- "0..1" Charger : spaceId
Charger "1" -- "0..*" ChargingSession : chargerId
ParkingSession "1" -- "0..*" ChargingSession : parkingSessionId
Reservation "0..1" -- "0..1" ParkingSession : 核销时关联
MonthlyPass "0..1" -- "0..*" ParkingSession : 权益快照
ParkingSession "1" -- "0..1" Bill : 结算账单
Bill "1" -- "0..*" Payment : billId
Bill "1" -- "0..*" InvoiceRequest : billId
note bottom
跨服务实线是领域概念关联；实现仅保存 ID/DTO 快照，
不建立跨库外键或跨库 JOIN。
end note
@enduml
